  - `[mainshock71, mainshock71 + 2 days]`
- Derives bin-level directional and along-strike metrics:
  - principal orientation
  - spread/elongation
  - nearest-fault distance stats
  - dominant local fault strike
  - angular misfit
  - along-strike occupancy and cumulative activation
- Saves validation, metadata, and question-summary CSV outputs.
